The documentation shows that `/* v8 ignore next */` on catch blocks is marked as incorrect syntax. Please try adding the `-- @preserve` suffix:

```ts
catch (err) /* v8 ignore next -- @preserve */ {
  console.error(err);
}
```

See `docs/guide/coverage.md` for examples. If this doesn't resolve it with rolldown-vite, please share a minimal reproduction repo.
